{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Grave Stone is a decorative piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"]," that can be purchased from ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],"'s stand at the ",["l","万灵节","Spirit's Eve"]," festival for 350g or on ",["l","冬季","Winter 15"]," from the ",["l","夜市#Magic Shop Boat","Magic Shop Boat"]," at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," for 200g. It can be won from the Crane Game inside the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],", during Fall."]],["p",["It may be placed anywhere in ",["l","Stardew Valley","Stardew Valley"],", indoors or out."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.3.27","1.3.27"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be obtained from Crane Game in the Movie Theater. Grave Stones can now be stacked in a player's ",["l","物品栏","inventory"]," and in ",["l","宝箱","chest"],"s."]]]]]]]}